Problems/Problem U8\">U8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U9 (page does not exist)\">U9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_iTest_Problems/Problem_U10&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2006 iTest Problems/Problem U10 (page does not exist)\">U10</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017212418\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.035 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.053 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 167/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 2881/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 659/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 4855/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.294      1 Template:ITest_box\n100.00%    7.294      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:17990:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017212418 and revision id 114743. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}